, J_BP2 S2 (x=80.0, 2x10), J_BP3 S3 (x=133.5, 2x10)." (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid 6eee3029-367b-56e3-847d-9faf85f48e88))(text "Pin 1 od strony mniejszego x, wszystkie nieparzyste GND. Tasma ok. 30 mm do P12; P12 laczy sieci po nazwie. Zastepuja J1-J8 z R2.2." (at 20.32 39.37 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 252b8981-7b0b-57c9-9d3c-1be758784bff))(text "J_BP1: panel P11 (PANELSAFE, piny 2/4/6/8/14 jak J_P12), SENSOR do P08, DAQ_OK z P05. J_BP2: DRIVE do P07 (czeka na P07), P02 (12/16/18 jak J_BP P02 R4)." (at 20.32 48.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 31a87b9d-01cd-5c8b-910a-7d5ff936dfc0))(text "J_BP3: P03 R6 (12/14/16/18/20 jak J_BP3 P03), 5V_SYS tylko na kolek serwisowy, 3V3_IO zasila plytke (takze J_BP2.10)." (at 20.32 57.15 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 4e1d78d8-b6f2-57cc-bf03-5a716cb90aea))(text "3V3 wychodzi z plytki tylko przez rezystory: PANEL_3V3 R40 100R (J_BP1.2), P04_3V3 R39 1k (J_BP2.14), PG_SEND R38 1k (J_BP2.20)." (at 20.32 254.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 758ef398-b08c-5524-9b68-733a6a463a22))(text "SAFE_N (J_BP2.16): wspolny wezel z otwartymi kolektorami; P12 laczy go z P02 R4 (Q7) i P07. Nazwy SUP_N_OUT i P04_3V3 jak w P12 (w R2.2: SUP_N, PG_3V3)." (at 20.32 264.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 9949feab-afa1-5c4c-9d21-26526abc29ee))(text "P04-R3 / 02   ZLACZA J_BP1-J_BP3 DO P12 (KRAWEDZ A)" (at 20.32 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 17789b0f-7ae1-5a5f-8859-80c5fd064662))(wire (pts (xy 50.8 93.98) (xy 45.72 93.98)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid e91b622a-b3d4-51fc-8c63-396c97696c53))(global_label "GND" (shape passive) (at 45.72 93.98 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid 108210ab-5fe6-5e71-81e1-32b52e641e49))(wire (pts (xy 63.5 93.98) (xy 68.58 93.98)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid 04a388